# UI system

Tremor has been **removed** from this project. Do not reinstall or import `@tremor/react`.

## What to use

- Plain HTML + Tailwind with design tokens from `src/app/globals.css`
- Shared primitives in `src/components/ui` (`Button`, `TextInput`, `Switch`, `Sheet`, `DateRangePicker`, `SearchableSelect`, …)
- Product-specific libraries when they fit (e.g. country pickers)
- Keep components small and focused; match surrounding styles
